    "OA-P2-2013-MJ::2::q2-c": {
      "prompt": "(i) Outline TWO guidelines that a receptionist should follow when taking telephone messages. (2 marks)\n(ii) Assume that you are Maya, a receptionist at Office Plus Inc. Indicate what actions you would take for EACH of the following situations:\na) An angry customer calls to report that the photocopying machine that she purchased recently from your company is faulty.\nb) The human resource manager wants to get in contact with a client immediately and gives you the client’s telephone number to dial. You dial the number but keep getting a busy signal.\nc) A message was left at your desk to call the travel agency to confirm your supervisor’s flight to an upcoming office supplies trade fair. You accidentally dial the wrong number.\nd) You call to make hotel reservations at the Caribbean Spa Resort for your manager. You hear a pre-recorded message. (8 marks)",
      "promptVerified": true,
